# Dogfooding: the catalog's own skills, installed by `mass-skills` and tracked in
# mass-skills.lock.json, are committed (.claude/skills/ and .agents/skills/). Only the CLI's
# audit log and per-machine Claude Code files stay out.
mass-skills.audit.jsonl
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/

node_modules/
dist/
apps/site/dist/
.astro/
*.tsbuildinfo
.astro-build.lock
# written by security-scan.yml and downloaded by pages.yml before the site build; never committed
security-status.json

.specs/
.design/
